<BaseLayout title="Store — Crimson Lantern Studios">

  <!-- ===== Section Header ===== -->
  <section class="store-section">
    <div class="section-label">STORE</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Music Asset Packs</h2>
    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <!-- ===== Intro ===== -->
    <div class="store-intro fade-in">
      <p>All music packs are original compositions created using AIVA, with full copyright ownership held by Crimson Lantern Studios. Each pack includes WAV (16-bit, 44.1kHz), OGG Vorbis (~192kbps), and MP3 (320kbps) formats. All tracks are composed in G# minor for seamless in-game mixing and crossfading.</p>
      <p>These are full-length compositions (5–5.5 minutes each), not loops. Built for cinematics, menus, exploration, combat, boss encounters, and extended gameplay sessions. 40-second demo previews are included in every pack.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== Pack Cards ===== -->
    <div class="store-grid">

      <!-- Pack 1 — Disturbingly Beautiful -->
      <div class="store-card fade-in">
        <h3 class="store-card-title">Disturbingly Beautiful — Ambient Synthwave</h3>
        <p class="store-card-desc">Impossible to categorize. Deeply compelling. Atmosphere that pulls you in and doesn't let go.</p>
        <p class="store-card-meta">20 original compositions · 106 minutes · 3 formats · G# minor</p>
        <p class="store-card-format">Full-length compositions — not loops. Built for cinematics, menus, exploration, and extended gameplay.</p>
        <div class="pack-waveform" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
        <AudioPreviews packSlug="disturbingly-beautiful" tracks={disturbinglyBeautifulTracks} />
        <p class="store-card-price">$80</p>
        <!-- Coming soon: swap <span> to <a href="..."> when live -->
        <p class="store-card-availability">Available now on: <span class="store-link">itch.io</span> · Coming soon to: <span class="store-link">Unity Asset Store</span> · <span class="store-link">FAB</span></p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pack 2 — Blood & Adrenaline -->
      <div class="store-card fade-in">
        <h3 class="store-card-title">Blood &amp; Adrenaline — Combat Music</h3>
        <p class="store-card-desc">Liquid DnB meets dystopian intensity. Built for combat encounters, chase sequences, and high-tension gameplay.</p>
        <p class="store-card-meta">20 original compositions · 106 minutes · 3 formats · G# minor</p>
        <p class="store-card-format">Full-length compositions — not loops. Built for combat, pursuit, and high-tension gameplay.</p>
        <div class="pack-waveform" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
        <AudioPreviews packSlug="blood-and-adrenaline" tracks={bloodAndAdrenalineTracks} />
        <p class="store-card-price">$80</p>
        <!-- Coming soon: swap <span> to <a href="..."> when live -->
        <p class="store-card-availability">Available now on: <span class="store-link">itch.io</span> · Coming soon to: <span class="store-link">Unity Asset Store</span> · <span class="store-link">FAB</span></p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pack 3 — Rise To It -->
      <div class="store-card fade-in">
        <h3 class="store-card-title">Rise To It — Boss Battle Anthology</h3>
        <p class="store-card-desc">Angelic metal meets hypnotic fury. Built for boss encounters, climactic moments, and final confrontations.</p>
        <p class="store-card-meta">20 original compositions · 106 minutes · 3 formats · G# minor</p>
        <p class="store-card-format">Full-length compositions — not loops. Built for boss encounters, climax moments, and endgame content.</p>
        <div class="pack-waveform" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
        <AudioPreviews packSlug="rise-to-it" tracks={riseToItTracks} />
        <p class="store-card-price">$80</p>
        <!-- Coming soon: swap <span> to <a href="..."> when live -->
        <p class="store-card-availability">Available now on: <span class="store-link">itch.io</span> · Coming soon to: <span class="store-link">Unity Asset Store</span> · <span class="store-link">FAB</span></p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pack 4 — Hearthstone & Cobble -->
      <div class="store-card fade-in">
        <h3 class="store-card-title">Hearthstone &amp; Cobble — Area &amp; Town BGM</h3>
        <p class="store-card-desc">Warm, lived-in, quietly alive. Built for towns, villages, markets, and safe zones.</p>
        <p class="store-card-meta">20 original compositions · 106 minutes · 3 formats · G# minor</p>
        <p class="store-card-format">Full-length compositions — not loops. Built for towns, villages, markets, and safe zones.</p>
        <div class="pack-waveform" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
        <AudioPreviews packSlug="hearthstone-and-cobble" tracks={hearthstoneAndCobbleTracks} />
        <p class="store-card-price">$80</p>
        <!-- Coming soon: swap <span> to <a href="..."> when live -->
        <p class="store-card-availability">Available now on: <span class="store-link">itch.io</span> · Coming soon to: <span class="store-link">Unity Asset Store</span> · <span class="store-link">FAB</span></p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pack 5 — Wanderer's Rest -->
      <div class="store-card fade-in">
        <h3 class="store-card-title">Wanderer's Rest — Exploration &amp; Travel BGM</h3>
        <p class="store-card-desc">Open roads and quiet miles. Built for overworlds, trails, campsites, and open exploration.</p>
        <p class="store-card-meta">20 original compositions · 107 minutes · 3 formats · G# minor</p>
        <p class="store-card-format">Full-length compositions — not loops. Built for overworlds, trails, campsites, and open exploration.</p>
